From: Dallas Delaney <dadelan@microsoft.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 17:23:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] erofs: add signed dm-verity mapper foundation

Add fail-closed PKCS#7 activation for precomputed EROFS layers while preserving the existing unsigned mapper setup and loop fallback. Bind signed mount options to the selected root hash and signature digest, consume the exact validated signature bytes, verify reused mapper tables, and serialize shared mapper mount and unmount lifecycle.

Normalize SELinux context only for shared signed dm-verity devices and force signed layers through verified kernel mounts.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

